      "shift": "28 Jan 2026, Shift 1",
      "status": "draft",
      "stem": "Two point charges of 1 nC and 2 nC are placed at the two corners of equilateral triangle of side 3 cm . The work done in bringing a charge of 3 nC from infinity to the third corner of the triangle is $\\_\\_\\_\\_$ $\\mu\\,\\mathrm{J}$.\n$\\; \\frac{1}{4\\pi E_0} = 9 \\times 10^9 \\,\\mathrm{N}\\cdot\\mathrm{m}^2 / \\mathrm{C}^2$",
